### GET actuator health (should return 200 status)
GET localhost:8080/actuator/health

### GET watchlists (unauthenticated, should return 401)
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlist/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST register user (expect 201, user created with access token. rerun expects 409, email already in use)
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### POST login user (expect 200, user logged in + token)
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
%}


### POST login user (expect 401, wrong password)
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password1234"
}

### GET logged in user (me) (expect 200, user details... assuming token is valid)
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}